Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): port end4-pC's About page

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: modules/ii/settings/pages/About.qml
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
Problem: The standalone settings window still has the pin's static About
page instead of end4-pC's richer system-info cards.
Port: hand-ported (update buttons, Packages and Updates cards dropped; pin revision, patch count and dotfiles path added)
Drop when: the pinned About.qml grows the same system-info cards natively.
